OL,3,GNEWSAShould parking charges at Leeds
OL,4,Aparks be scrapped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking charges are set to be scrapped
OL,7,Fin towns and suburbs around Leeds after
OL,8,Fpublic backlash. Now people opposed to
OL,9,Fequally unpopular charges introduced at
OL,10,Fthe city's parks are calling for those
OL,11,Ffees to be removed as well.
OL,13,F"I don't see any reason why people
OL,14,Fshould have to pay to enjoy a walk,
OL,15,Fregular exercise and that sort of
OL,16,Fthing," says John England.
OL,18,FLike many others, England walks his dog
OL,19,Fat Roundhay Park and Golden Acre Park
OL,20,Fseveral times a week
