OL,3,GNEWSAShould parking charges at Leeds
OL,4,Aparks be scrapped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking charges were introduced at both
OL,7,Flocations - along with Otley Chevin,
OL,8,FTemple Newsam and Middleton Park - in
OL,9,FFebruary 2025 - with two hours parking
OL,10,Fcurrently costing #1.20.
